# Vivastreet

> Vivastreet is the UK's second-largest free classified ads marketplace, founded in 2004 under Digital Ventures Services Limited (registered in England and Wales). The platform connects buyers and sellers across property, vehicles, jobs, services, and personal categories. Vivastreet serves over 10 million monthly visitors in the United Kingdom.

This file highlights the most important sections of Vivastreet for AI systems, agents, and automated assistants. It is intended to help machines understand the platform, its key commercial categories, and the most authoritative help, trust, safety, and policy resources.

## Priority

- [Escort](https://www.vivastreet.co.uk/escort): Vivastreet's most commercially important category and a key revenue-driving section of the platform.

- [How to Feature an Ad](https://www.vivastreet.co.uk/s/how_to_feature_ad): Guide to premium ad options including Featured, Highlighted, and Reposted listings.

- [Online Safety Act](https://www.vivastreet.co.uk/s/online-safety-act): Information about age assurance, moderation, and compliance measures relevant to sensitive categories including Escorts and Massage.

## Core Platform

- [Homepage](https://www.vivastreet.co.uk/): Browse all classified ad categories across the UK.

- [Property to Rent](https://www.vivastreet.co.uk/property+to+rent): UK rental listings by region.

- [Cars for Sale](https://www.vivastreet.co.uk/cars+for+sale): Used and new car classified listings.

- [Jobs](https://www.vivastreet.co.uk/jobs): UK job vacancies and part-time roles.

- [Services](https://www.vivastreet.co.uk/services): Local tradespeople and professional services.

- [Buy and Sell](https://www.vivastreet.co.uk/buy+and+sell): Second-hand goods across the UK.

